			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"The Great Sage has been slain.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is for the best... better than to doubt Elsa-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even if it means losing my one and only redeeming quality...”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't get so down. You'll be back to your winning ways without Elsa's dirty tricks.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No... I can tell.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Now that I have learned to doubt, Oomikami will no longer grant me His blessing.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am now... but an ordinary human!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes begin to well up with tears.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now you've done it.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, you went too far.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
