			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shiinoha-san, I'm sorry. I was being childish.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There's no rush or anything, so let's find you a new skill, all right?”",
